 "title": "Man vs. zone: the two ways to cover receivers",
 "html": "<p><strong>Man coverage:</strong> each defender is assigned one receiver and follows him everywhere, like a shadow. It's strong when your defenders are as fast as their receivers. The weakness: if a receiver gets a step on his man, nobody else is nearby to help, so it can become a long play.</p>\n<p><strong>Zone coverage:</strong> each defender guards an area, not a person, and covers whoever runs into it. It's safer against long plays because some defenders always stay deep. The weakness: there are gaps between areas, and good QBs throw into those gaps.</p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 206\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Man coverage, where each defender is tied to one receiver, next to zone coverage, where each defender guards a shaded area\"><defs><marker id=\"m14w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m14y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"202\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,.35)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"22\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">MAN</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"22\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">ZONE</text><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"190\" y1=\"160\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"210\" x2=\"390\" y1=\"160\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"174\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"177.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"174\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"177.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"174\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"177.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"174\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"177.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"174\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"177.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"174\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"177.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"132\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"135.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"132\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"135.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">NB</text><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"132\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"135.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"58\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"61.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><line x1=\"30\" x2=\"30\" y1=\"143\" y2=\"163\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"100\" x2=\"100\" y1=\"143\" y2=\"163\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"170\" x2=\"170\" y1=\"143\" y2=\"163\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"82\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">one safety helps deep</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"104\" width=\"56\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.13)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"272\" y=\"104\" width=\"56\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.13)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"332\" y=\"104\" width=\"56\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.13)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"212\" y=\"36\" width=\"86\" height=\"58\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.26)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><rect x=\"302\" y=\"36\" width=\"86\" height=\"58\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.26)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"126\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"129.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"126\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"129.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"126\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"129.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"255\" cy=\"66\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"255\" y=\"69.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"66\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"69.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"198\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">each defender follows one receiver</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"198\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">each defender guards an area</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\">Left: man. Dashed lines tie each defender to his receiver; one safety stays deep as backup. Right: zone. Dashed boxes are short areas, solid boxes are deep areas.</p>\n<p><strong>Real example:</strong> Aaron Rodgers threw touchdowns of 38 and 23 yards against Cincinnati. Long touchdowns usually come from man coverage: one receiver beats one defender, and there's no teammate behind to stop him.</p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 176\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Motion tells man from zone: in man a defender runs across with the moving receiver, in zone nobody follows\"><defs><marker id=\"m15w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m15y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,.35)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"22\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">MAN: someone follows</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"22\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">ZONE: nobody follows</text><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"192\" y1=\"120\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"208\" x2=\"392\" y1=\"120\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M26 136 L150 136\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m15w)\"/><path d=\"M26 98 L148 98\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m15y)\"/><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"136\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"139.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"98\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"101.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"70\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"73.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><path d=\"M226 136 L350 136\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m15w)\"/><path d=\"M222 98 L236 78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m15y)\"/><path d=\"M360 70 L344 88\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m15y)\"/><circle cx=\"222\" cy=\"136\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"222\" y=\"139.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"222\" cy=\"98\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"222\" y=\"101.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"70\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"73.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">CB runs across with him</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">defenders just shuffle a step</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\">Motion before the snap is the easiest man-vs-zone tell. White arrow: the receiver in motion. Yellow dashes: what the defense does.</p>\n<p><strong>How to spot it on TV:</strong> before the snap, watch a receiver who goes in motion across the formation. If one defender runs across with him, it's man. If nobody follows and the defenders just shuffle a step, it's zone. Lesson 8 covers the specific zone types (Cover 2, 3 and 4).</p>\n<p class=\"note\">Next: blitzes, and why sending extra rushers is a gamble.</p>",
